# Hiding Behind the Truth (Q025) from Benedict's start to Triol's pawn: Agripel's gemstone key,
# the Mysterious Wizard's errand, the three broken bookshelves, the last one opened holding the
# gem box, which wakes the pawn far away (cond 7); while it stands, the box answers that it is the
# player's own. Expectations come from the reference trace (Q025_HidingBehindTheTruth.onAdvEvent,
# onTalk, Quest.createOnePrivateEx). The pawn line gives the server the pawn's template; that pawn
# stands out of sight.
